	(label "ESP32_GPIO1"
		(at 175.26 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0a837342-7904-40af-91f0-6dc41ac3ed9a")
	)
	(text "CIRCUIT DESIGN & OPERATING PARAMETERS:\n1. Power Supply: +3.3V from ESP32-S3. Quiescent DC bias = 1.65V (mid-supply).\n2. Microphone Bias: R1 (10k) provides JFET capsule power from +3.3V.\n3. AC Gain: Av = 1 + (R4 / R5) = 1 + (100k / 1k) = 101 (~40.1 dB).\n4. High-pass Cutoff (Feedback loop): fc = 1 / (2*pi*R5*C3) = 15.9 Hz.\n5. Output Low-pass / Anti-Aliasing Filter: fc = 1 / (2*pi*R6*C4) = 15.9 kHz.\n6. NOTE ON C2 (10uF): In the original prompt ASCII, C2 was drawn across R3 at Pin 3.\n   If populated directly on Pin 3, C2 shorts out audio signals (>30Hz). Marked DNP\n   to preserve audio bandwidth. For filtered Vbias, add a series isolation resistor."
		(at 43.18 152.40 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4682911c-a158-408f-aa6a-df04153ea6f5")
	)
